{"seq":1,"slug":"deferred-deep-link-flow","title":"延迟深链流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/deferred/deferred-deep-link-flow","wordCount":986,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"延迟深链流程\">延迟深链流程</h1><p>延迟深链（Deferred Deep Link）解决的是一个经典难题：用户点击了一个深链，但此时 App 尚未安装。操作系统将用户跳转到 App Store，用户完成安装并首次打开 App 时，如何让 App 知道用户最初的意图并跳转到对应页面？</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>意图保存</strong>：用户点击链接时，归因服务器记录目标 URL 和设备指纹快照，作为后续匹配的依据</li>\n<li><strong>归因窗口（Attribution Window）</strong>：意图记录的有效期（通常 7–30 天），超出窗口期的安装不再尝试延迟深链匹配</li>\n<li><strong>首次启动查询</strong>：App 在 <code>didFinishLaunchingWithOptions</code> 或 <code>Application.onCreate</code> 时向归因服务器查询是否存在匹配的延迟深链参数</li>\n<li><strong>超时保护</strong>：查询设置 1–2 秒超时，防止网络不可用时用户卡在加载状态，超时后跳转默认首页</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"整体流程\">整体流程</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant User as 用户&#10;    participant Browser as 浏览器&#10;    participant Server as 归因服务器&#10;    participant Store as App Store&#10;    participant App as App(首次启动)&#10;&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;Browser: 点击深链 https://example.com/product/123&#10;    Browser-&gt;&gt;Server: 请求页面(带 HTTP 头:UA、IP 等)&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 记录意图 + 设备指纹快照&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Browser: 返回 Smart Banner / 降级页面&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;Store: 点击&quot;下载&quot;跳转 App Store&#10;    User-&gt;&gt;App: 安装并首次打开&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;Server: 发送首次启动信号(设备指纹)&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 指纹匹配,找到对应意图&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;App: 返回延迟的深链参数&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;App: 解析参数,导航到 /product/123\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant Browser as 浏览器\n    participant Server as 归因服务器\n    participant Store as App Store\n    participant App as App(首次启动)\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;Browser: 点击深链 https://example.com/product/123\n    Browser-&gt;&gt;Server: 请求页面(带 HTTP 头:UA、IP 等)\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 记录意图 + 设备指纹快照\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Browser: 返回 Smart Banner / 降级页面\n    User-&gt;&gt;Store: 点击\"下载\"跳转 App Store\n    User-&gt;&gt;App: 安装并首次打开\n    App-&gt;&gt;Server: 发送首次启动信号(设备指纹)\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Server: 指纹匹配,找到对应意图\n    Server-&gt;&gt;App: 返回延迟的深链参数\n    App-&gt;&gt;App: 解析参数,导航到 /product/123</pre><h2 id=\"意图保存阶段\">意图保存阶段</h2><p>用户点击链接时，归因服务器需要记录足够的上下文来识别这个&quot;意图&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"意图记录 = {&#10;  link_url: &quot;https://example.com/product/123&quot;,&#10;  timestamp: 1720000000,&#10;  device_fingerprint: {&#10;    ip: &quot;203.0.113.5&quot;,&#10;    user_agent: &quot;Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 17_4...)&quot;,&#10;    screen_resolution: &quot;390x844&quot;,&#10;    timezone: &quot;Asia/Shanghai&quot;,&#10;    language: &quot;zh-CN&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  utm_params: {&#10;    source: &quot;facebook&quot;,&#10;    medium: &quot;cpc&quot;,&#10;    campaign: &quot;summer_sale&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>意图记录 = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  link_url: \"https://example.com/product/123\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  timestamp: 1720000000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  device_fingerprint: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ip: \"203.0.113.5\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    user_agent: \"Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 17_4...)\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    screen_resolution: \"390x844\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    timezone: \"Asia/Shanghai\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    language: \"zh-CN\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  utm_params: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    source: \"facebook\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    medium: \"cpc\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    campaign: \"summer_sale\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>归因窗口（Attribution Window）是意图记录的有效期，通常设置为 7–30 天。超出窗口期的安装不再尝试延迟深链匹配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"app-首次启动的意图恢复\">App 首次启动的意图恢复</h2><p>首次打开时，App 需要尽快（通常在 <code>application:didFinishLaunchingWithOptions:</code> 或 <code>Application</code> 初始化时）向归因服务器发起查询：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// iOS 集成示例（以 Branch SDK 为例）&#10;import BranchPluginSupport&#10;&#10;@UIApplicationMain&#10;class AppDelegate: UIResponder, UIApplicationDelegate {&#10;    func application(_ application: UIApplication,&#10;                     didFinishLaunchingWithOptions launchOptions: [UIApplication.LaunchOptionsKey: Any]?) -&gt; Bool {&#10;        Branch.getInstance().initSession(launchOptions: launchOptions) { params, error in&#10;            guard error == nil, let params = params as? [String: Any] else { return }&#10;            if let deepLinkURL = params[&quot;+non_branch_link&quot;] as? String&#10;                ?? (params[&quot;~referring_link&quot;] as? String) {&#10;                DeepLinkRouter.shared.handleDeferredLink(deepLinkURL, params: params)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        return true&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// iOS 集成示例（以 Branch SDK 为例）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BranchPluginSupport</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@UIApplicationMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AppDelegate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UIResponder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UIApplicationDelegate </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> application</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> application: UIApplication,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                     didFinishLaunchingWithOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> launchOptions: [UIApplication.LaunchOptionsKey: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Branch.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">getInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">initSession</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">launchOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: launchOptions) { params, error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            guard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deepLinkURL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"+non_branch_link\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                ??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (params[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"~referring_link\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                DeepLinkRouter.shared.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">handleDeferredLink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(deepLinkURL, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: params)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Android 端的集成位置通常在 <code>Application.onCreate()</code> 或主 Activity 的 <code>onCreate()</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class MainActivity : AppCompatActivity() {&#10;    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {&#10;        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)&#10;        Branch.getInstance().initSession(object : Branch.BranchReferralInitListener {&#10;            override fun onInitFinished(referringParams: JSONObject?, error: BranchError?) {&#10;                if (error == null &amp;&amp; referringParams != null) {&#10;                    val deepLinkUrl = referringParams.optString(&quot;+non_branch_link&quot;)&#10;                    if (deepLinkUrl.isNotEmpty()) {&#10;                        DeepLinkRouter.handleDeferredLink(deepLinkUrl, referringParams)&#10;                    }&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }, this.intent.data, this)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MainActivity : AppCompatActivity() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onCreate(savedInstanceState: Bundle?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        super.onCreate(savedInstanceState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Branch.getInstance().initSession(object : Branch.BranchReferralInitListener {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            override fun onInitFinished(referringParams: JSONObject?, error: BranchError?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (error == null &#x26;&#x26; referringParams != null) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    val deepLinkUrl = referringParams.optString(\"+non_branch_link\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    if (deepLinkUrl.isNotEmpty()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        DeepLinkRouter.handleDeferredLink(deepLinkUrl, referringParams)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }, this.intent.data, this)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"延迟深链的关键时序问题\">延迟深链的关键时序问题</h2><p>首次启动时 App 需要在导航到默认页面之前等待延迟深链查询完成，但网络请求可能超时。工程上通常采用两种处理方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处理策略</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>启动屏等待</td>\n<td>延长 Launch Screen 显示，查询完成后再导航</td>\n<td>用户转化率要求高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乐观导航</td>\n<td>先到首页，查询完成后再弹出目标页</td>\n<td>用户体验要求高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时保护</td>\n<td>设置 1-2 秒超时，超时则跳过延迟深链</td>\n<td>网络条件差的场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>超时保护是必须的，避免网络不可用时用户卡在加载状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 设置超时的伪代码&#10;let timeout = DispatchWorkItem {&#10;    // 超时后跳过延迟深链，直接进入首页&#10;    navigateToHome()&#10;}&#10;DispatchQueue.main.asyncAfter(deadline: .now() + 2.0, execute: timeout)&#10;&#10;Branch.getInstance().initSession { params, error in&#10;    timeout.cancel()&#10;    handleDeferredLink(params)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设置超时的伪代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timeout </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> DispatchWorkItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 超时后跳过延迟深链，直接进入首页</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    navigateToHome</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DispatchQueue.main.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">asyncAfter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">deadline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: timeout)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Branch.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">getInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">initSession</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { params, error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    timeout.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cancel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    handleDeferredLink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ios-app-clips-与-storekit-2-的影响\">iOS App Clips 与 StoreKit 2 的影响</h2><p>iOS 14 引入了 App Clips，它提供了一种不需要完整安装即可体验功能的方式，配合延迟深链可以实现更流畅的用户引导。App Clips 通过 <code>NSUserActivityTypes</code> 中的 <code>com.apple.coremotionaudio.clip-launch</code> 类型处理激活 URL，并可以在用户完整安装 App 后通过 <code>UserDefaults</code> 共享数据（需要 App Group 配置）。</p>\n<p>StoreKit 2 引入的 <code>SKAdNetwork 4.0</code> 则影响了付费渠道的归因窗口和粒度，详见延迟深链与 SKAN 的整合策略部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自有延迟深链服务的实现要点\">自有延迟深链服务的实现要点</h2><p>不依赖第三方 SDK 自建延迟深链服务时，核心组件包括：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[点击追踪服务] --&gt; B[指纹存储 Redis]&#10;    B --&gt; C[首次启动 API]&#10;    C --&gt; D[指纹匹配引擎]&#10;    D --&gt; E[意图 DB]&#10;    E --&gt; F[返回深链参数]\">graph LR\n    A[点击追踪服务] --&gt; B[指纹存储 Redis]\n    B --&gt; C[首次启动 API]\n    C --&gt; D[指纹匹配引擎]\n    D --&gt; E[意图 DB]\n    E --&gt; F[返回深链参数]</pre><p>Redis 缓存指纹记录，TTL 设置为归因窗口期（如 7 天）。匹配算法根据各字段的区分度加权打分，超过置信度阈值则认为匹配成功，否则返回空（用户从默认首页进入）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>延迟深链的实现关键在于时序管理和异常处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>首次启动时机</strong>：在 App 生命周期最早的可能位置（iOS <code>didFinishLaunching</code>，Android <code>Application.onCreate</code>）发起查询，确保深链参数在 UI 初始化前就绪</li>\n<li><strong>超时策略</strong>：固定 1–2 秒超时，超时后乐观导航到首页或显示 Launch Screen，不阻塞用户</li>\n<li><strong>单次触发</strong>：使用持久化标志（UserDefaults / SharedPreferences）记录是否已完成延迟深链检查，避免重启 App 时重复触发</li>\n<li><strong>意图有效性验证</strong>：匹配到延迟深链后，验证目标页面是否仍然有效（如商品是否下架），无效时优雅降级到首页或相关页面</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>本章相关文档：</strong> <a href=\"fingerprint-attribution\">指纹归因技术</a> 深入设备指纹的信号与匹配算法；<a href=\"clipboard-paste-detection\">剪贴板与粘贴检测</a> 介绍剪贴板方案在 iOS 隐私约束下的实现方式。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"延迟深链流程","id":"延迟深链流程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"整体流程","id":"整体流程"},{"level":2,"text":"意图保存阶段","id":"意图保存阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"App 首次启动的意图恢复","id":"app-首次启动的意图恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟深链的关键时序问题","id":"延迟深链的关键时序问题"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS App Clips 与 StoreKit 2 的影响","id":"ios-app-clips-与-storekit-2-的影响"},{"level":2,"text":"自有延迟深链服务的实现要点","id":"自有延迟深链服务的实现要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自定义 URI Scheme","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/fundamentals/custom-uri-scheme"},"next":{"title":"指纹归因技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/deferred/fingerprint-attribution"}}